who wants to date a closeted

1032
01:02:45.700 --> 01:02:48.570
49-year-old
with three children.

1033
01:02:48.670 --> 01:02:50.437
Would you be willing
to date someone

1034
01:02:50.538 --> 01:02:53.807
from Long Island
or New Jersey?

1035
01:02:53.907 --> 01:02:55.677
I want to prioritize
dating a man

1036
01:02:55.776 --> 01:02:57.512
who's white at first

1037
01:02:57.612 --> 01:03:01.616
but then if we have no luck,
we can move on to other races.

1038
01:03:01.716 --> 01:03:04.084
LUCY: So "whites only,"
at first?

1039
01:03:04.184 --> 01:03:07.955
I mean, technically,
I'm open to all ethnicities.

1040
01:03:08.055 --> 01:03:09.957
Eleanor, "technically,"

1041
01:03:10.057 --> 01:03:13.427
you're asking me to set you up
with only white men.

1042
01:03:13.528 --> 01:03:16.196
I know the list looks long
but I deserve someone

1043
01:03:16.297 --> 01:03:18.132
who fulfills
all of my criteria.

1044
01:03:18.232 --> 01:03:19.300
I really do.

1045
01:03:19.400 --> 01:03:22.036
I mean look at me.
I'm a catch. (CHUCKLES)

1046
01:03:24.972 --> 01:03:27.975
Patricia,
I know that every year

1047
01:03:28.075 --> 01:03:29.711
you go without having
a husband...

1048
01:03:29.810 --> 01:03:33.814
raises your expectations
for him exponentially.

1049
01:03:33.914 --> 01:03:36.950
But that doesn't mean
that you're due to get one.

1050
01:03:37.051 --> 01:03:39.621
And it doesn't mean
that you can customize...

1051
01:03:39.721 --> 01:03:42.256
because this is
not a simulation.

1052
01:03:42.356 --> 01:03:44.024
If the service
I was providing you

1053
01:03:44.124 --> 01:03:45.926
was building you a man
then, of course,

1054
01:03:46.026 --> 01:03:49.430
I could build you a man with
everything on this list...

1055
01:03:50.532 --> 01:03:52.032
But I can't.

1056
01:03:52.132 --> 01:03:55.402
Because this is
not a car or a house.

1057
01:03:55.502 --> 01:03:57.104
We're talking about people.

1058
01:03:57.204 --> 01:04:00.441
People are people
are people are people.

1059
01:04:00.542 --> 01:04:02.276
They come as they are.

1060
01:04:02.376 --> 01:04:05.547
And all I can hope
to find for you

1061
01:04:05.647 --> 01:04:06.947
is a man that you can tolerate

1062
01:04:07.047 --> 01:04:10.150
for the next 50 years
who likes you at all.

1063
01:04:12.019 --> 01:04:13.588
And you are not a catch...

1064
01:04:14.589 --> 01:04:16.323
because you are not a fish.

1065
01:04:29.069 --> 01:04:32.005
I was managing
her expectations.

1066
01:04:34.074 --> 01:04:36.143
VIOLET: Patricia canceled
her membership

1067
01:04:36.243 --> 01:04:40.047
and reviewed us online,
calling us a scam.

1068
01:04:41.348 --> 01:04:43.117
We are a scam.

1069
01:04:43.217 --> 01:04:46.654
We don't give them
what they pay for, do we?

1070
01:04:46.755 --> 01:04:50.324
We promise them love
and then...

1071
01:04:50.424 --> 01:04:55.630
we just give them bad dates
with morons and criminals.

1072
01:05:00.802 --> 01:05:04.338
I know the Sophie L. situation
is still weighing on you.

1073
01:05:08.710 --> 01:05:11.211
Burnout is common
for matchmakers.

1074
01:05:11.880 --> 01:05:13.347
You need a break.

1075
01:05:13.447 --> 01:05:15.449
You should go on a trip
with your boyfriend.

1076
01:05:15.550 --> 01:05:16.917
(SCOFFS)

1077
01:05:19.052 --> 01:05:21.321
If I take a break right now...

1078
01:05:22.156 --> 01:05:24.158
I may never come back.

1079
01:05:24.258 --> 01:05:26.694
VIOLET: You will,
because you love your clients.

1080
01:05:26.795 --> 01:05:29.930
I hate them.
They are children.

1081
01:05:30.030 --> 01:05:32.332
I hate them.

1082
01:05:32.433 --> 01:05:34.101
VIOLET: They give us
thousands of dollars.

1083
01:05:34.201 --> 01:05:36.437
They're entitled
to some regression.

1084
01:05:38.305 --> 01:05:41.743
Do you think
that any one of them

1085
01:05:41.843 --> 01:05:43.511
says to their therapist...

1086
01:05:44.646 --> 01:05:48.315
"No Blacks, no fatties"?

1087
01:05:48.415 --> 01:05:50.250
And if I'm
their actual therapist,

1088
01:05:50.350 --> 01:05:52.953
which it feels like I am...

1089
01:05:53.053 --> 01:05:56.356
I don't have the schooling
to support that.

1090
01:05:56.457 --> 01:05:59.092
And I certainly
don't get paid enough.

1091
01:06:00.994 --> 01:06:04.264
VIOLET: Lucy, we're better
than therapists.

1092
01:06:04.364 --> 01:06:06.835
We work
with the most intimate...

1093
01:06:06.935 --> 01:06:08.268
extremely personal,

1094
01:06:08.368 --> 01:06:09.970
unofficial part
of their lives...

1095
01:06:10.070 --> 01:06:13.675
that they'd like to see
struck from the record.

1096
01:06:13.775 --> 01:06:16.778
We work with their
loneliness and rejection...

1097
01:06:16.878 --> 01:06:20.582
the kind that makes someone
get naked for a stranger.

1098
01:06:20.682 --> 01:06:22.015
We're the real deal.

1099
01:06:22.717 --> 01:06:23.984
That's why they tell you

1100
01:06:24.084 --> 01:06:26.053
more than they would
tell their therapists

1101
01:06:26.153 --> 01:06:28.288
and why they take
risks with you.

1102
01:06:30.023 --> 01:06:31.391
"Risks."

1103
01:06:31.492 --> 01:06:34.161
VIOLET: Yes. Risks that can
lead to a situation

1104
01:06:34.261 --> 01:06:36.564
like what happened
with Sophie L.

1105
01:06:36.664 --> 01:06:40.367
And risks that lead
to lifelong marriages.

1106
01:06:42.402 --> 01:06:44.806
You know
this is life-changing work.

1107
01:06:44.906 --> 01:06:46.373
And you're born for it.

1108
01:06:47.709 --> 01:06:49.376
Take a break starting now.

1109
01:06:49.476 --> 01:06:52.747
And I expect you back
in four weeks, renewed.

1110
01:06:53.413 --> 01:06:54.381
I insist.

1111
01:06:54.481 --> 01:06:56.584
-(CHEERING)
-(KNOCK ON DOOR)

1112
01:07:00.320 --> 01:07:02.456
ROSE: Violet! Amazing news!

1113
01:07:02.557 --> 01:07:06.393
My client Zoe H.
and Fred A. just got engaged!

1114
01:07:06.493 --> 01:07:08.763
(WOMEN CHEERING)

1115
01:07:08.863 --> 01:07:11.633
VIOLET: Unbelievable! Oh!

1116
01:07:11.733 --> 01:07:14.702
That is so impressive!

1117
01:07:14.802 --> 01:07:16.236
What an amazing match!

1118
01:07:16.336 --> 01:07:17.639
-Number four?
-(SIGHS)

1119
01:07:17.739 --> 01:07:19.807
-ROSE: Yes!
-We have to throw you a party!

1120
01:07:19.908 --> 01:07:21.676
(WOMEN SCREAMING)

1121
01:07:21.776 --> 01:07:23.745
(SOMBER MUSIC PLAYING)

1122
01:07:58.111 --> 01:08:00.347
(TENSE MUSIC PLAYING)

1123
01:08:01.950 --> 01:08:05.118
(MAN CHATTERING)

1124
01:08:37.685 --> 01:08:38.686
LUCY: Sophie.

1125
01:08:53.300 --> 01:08:55.502
(INDISTINCT CHATTER)

1126
01:09:12.020 --> 01:09:13.487
(PANTING) Sophie.

1127
01:09:16.456 --> 01:09:18.126
-Sophie.
-You don't want to talk to me.

1128
01:09:18.225 --> 01:09:19.894
Please.

1129
01:09:19.994 --> 01:09:21.495
I am so embarrassed.

1130
01:09:22.496 --> 01:09:23.831
I thought I could
pay some girl

1131
01:09:23.931 --> 01:09:25.566
to find me a boyfriend.

1132
01:09:26.166 --> 01:09:27.300
I'm sorry.

1133
01:09:27.401 --> 01:09:29.037
"An expert"?
What a fucking joke.

1134
01:09:29.137 --> 01:09:31.906
-Sophie-
-You know what's even funnier?

1135
01:09:32.006 --> 01:09:34.042
I almost felt like
we were friends.

1136
01:09:34.142 --> 01:09:35.910
I, I, I, I really-- I--

1137
01:09:36.010 --> 01:09:37.344
(BREATH TREMBLING)

1138
01:09:37.444 --> 01:09:39.379
Can we please just talk?

1139
01:09:40.313 --> 01:09:41.582
Talk about what?

1140
01:09:43.051 --> 01:09:44.652
What do you have to say?

1141
01:09:48.455 --> 01:09:50.323
(SIGHS, WHISPERING) I'm sorry.

1142
01:09:51.993 --> 01:09:54.194
(IN NORMAL VOICE)
I'm so sorry.

1143
01:09:55.763 --> 01:09:57.799
I trusted you.

1144
01:09:59.667 --> 01:10:02.235
I didn't know
what he was capable of.

1145
01:10:03.738 --> 01:10:05.707
I see, so...

1146
01:10:05.807 --> 01:10:09.911
you knew his height,
which was a lie by the way.

1147
01:10:10.011 --> 01:10:11.746
And his job and his salary,

1148
01:10:11.846 --> 01:10:13.915
which was also a lie
just for the record.

1149
01:10:14.015 --> 01:10:16.117
And his looks, which is
really nothing much...

1150
01:10:16.216 --> 01:10:18.318
but you didn't know
who he was.

1151
01:10:19.219 --> 01:10:22.857
As a person. As a man.

1152
01:10:22.957 --> 01:10:25.660
Well, I went on a date
with him and found out.

1153
01:10:26.761 --> 01:10:28.730
He's the kind of guy
who gets drunk

1154
01:10:28.830 --> 01:10:31.331
and follows you
into the bathroom.

1155
01:10:32.633 --> 01:10:33.701
(SIGHS)

1156
01:10:35.335 --> 01:10:37.705
Why would you set me up
with someone like that?

1157
01:10:41.676 --> 01:10:46.581
He was a strong match
with a lot of potential.

1158
01:10:51.552 --> 01:10:53.921
He checked a lot of our boxes.

1159
01:10:58.893 --> 01:11:00.027
"Boxes"?

1160
01:11:05.533 --> 01:11:07.101
The truth is,
you set me up with that man

1161
01:11:07.201 --> 01:11:08.770
because you think
I'm worthless.

1162
01:11:08.870 --> 01:11:10.071
LUCY: No, I don't--

1163
01:11:10.171 --> 01:11:11.739
You didn't know
what to do with me.

1164
01:11:11.839 --> 01:11:13.941
That's how I ended up
on that date.

1165
01:11:16.010 --> 01:11:19.247
Here I was thinking that
you worked for me...

1166
01:11:19.346 --> 01:11:21.582
but the whole time
I was working for you.

1167
01:11:23.184 --> 01:11:26.386
Worthless merchandise...

1168
01:11:26.486 --> 01:11:29.322
to pawn off to anyone
who'd take it.

1169
01:11:33.928 --> 01:11:35.797
But I am not merchandise.

1170
01:11:37.297 --> 01:11:38.633
I'm a person.

1171
01:11:40.735 --> 01:11:44.639
And I know I deserve love.
(SHUDDERS)

1172
01:11:44.739 --> 01:11:47.608
I know you do. I believe it.

1173
01:11:49.877 --> 01:11:51.311
Fuck you.

1174
01:11:52.146 --> 01:11:53.380
Pimp.

1175
01:11:54.148 --> 01:11:56.316
(SOBBING)

1176
01:12:33.855 --> 01:12:34.856
(THUDS)

1177
01:12:47.768 --> 01:12:48.903
(SNIFFLES)

1178
01:12:50.771 --> 01:12:52.306
-(PHONE VIBRATING)
-Thanks.

1179
01:12:52.405 --> 01:12:53.875
Can I get a receipt?

1180
01:12:53.975 --> 01:12:57.011
-(PHONE VIBRATING)
-(SPANISH CHATTER ON RADIO)

1181
01:13:00.081 --> 01:13:02.083
(PHONE CONTINUES VIBRATING)

1182
01:13:04.986 --> 01:13:05.987
Thanks, man.

1183
01:13:07.688 --> 01:13:08.689
Lucy?

1184
01:13:09.624 --> 01:13:11.325
What's going on? You okay?

1185
01:13:11.424 --> 01:13:14.461
LUCY: (SHUDDERING) <i>No.</i>

1186
01:13:14.562 --> 01:13:15.997
Do you want me
to come get you?

1187
01:13:17.497 --> 01:13:19.200
LUCY: <i>No, I'm at home.</i>

1188
01:13:19.300 --> 01:13:21.501
<i>I shouldn't even be</i>
<i>calling you.</i>

1189
01:13:21.602 --> 01:13:25.039
You can always call me.
What's up?

1190
01:13:26.473 --> 01:13:27.975
LUCY: <i>I fucked up.</i> (SOBS)

1191
01:13:31.379 --> 01:13:32.613
Okay.

1192
01:13:36.584 --> 01:13:39.887
I'm not supposed
to tell anybody but...

1193
01:13:43.057 --> 01:13:44.525
can I tell you?

1194
01:13:46.060 --> 01:13:47.094
JOHN: <i>Of course.</i>

1195
01:13:48.396 --> 01:13:49.597
<i>Anything.</i>

1196
01:13:55.536 --> 01:13:59.040
I set my client up
with a bad person.

1197
01:14:01.509 --> 01:14:04.245
I didn't know he was bad,
but I introduced them.

1198
01:14:04.345 --> 01:14:05.546
And now

1199
01:14:07.114 --> 01:14:09.383
I can't fix it.

1200
01:14:09.482 --> 01:14:12.720
I'm the last person
who can fix it.

1201
01:14:17.291 --> 01:14:19.093
Do you want me to come over?

1202
01:14:19.193 --> 01:14:21.295
LUCY: <i>No.</i>

1203
01:14:21.395 --> 01:14:24.932
<i>No. I'm about</i>
<i>to go to Harry's.</i>

1204
01:14:26.434 --> 01:14:27.668
Right.

1205
01:14:28.936 --> 01:14:30.104
LUCY: <i>Sorry.</i>

1206
01:14:30.204 --> 01:14:34.141
No, no. It's... Hey,
nothing to be sorry about.

1207
01:14:34.241 --> 01:14:35.943
Keep telling me what happened.

1208
01:14:37.311 --> 01:14:38.612
I'm here.

1209
01:14:40.414 --> 01:14:42.616
(WATER RUNNING)

1210
01:17:11.632 --> 01:17:13.334
(HARRY SIGHS)

1211
01:17:16.337 --> 01:17:17.738
Do you know what they are?

1212
01:17:18.573 --> 01:17:19.874
I think so.

1213
01:17:21.576 --> 01:17:23.844
-It's not a big deal.
-I know.

1214
01:17:27.381 --> 01:17:28.916
I made an investment.

1215
01:17:30.751 --> 01:17:32.052
A body is like an apartment.

1216
01:17:32.153 --> 01:17:34.188
You have to invest
to get the value back.

1217
01:17:36.223 --> 01:17:37.725
I understand you.

1218
01:17:39.360 --> 01:17:40.961
I invested too.

1219
01:17:46.800 --> 01:17:48.402
HARRY: Right. I figured.

1220
01:17:52.940 --> 01:17:55.176
Did your brother too?

1221
01:17:55.276 --> 01:17:58.913
HARRY: Yeah, we did it
together eight years ago.

1222
01:18:02.116 --> 01:18:04.885
Six feet or taller was one of
Charlotte's non-negotiables...

1223
01:18:04.985 --> 01:18:07.254
so I'm glad he did.

1224
01:18:09.757 --> 01:18:11.225
Was it painful?

1225
01:18:14.962 --> 01:18:16.263
I know it sounds stupid,

1226
01:18:16.363 --> 01:18:18.232
breaking your legs to gain
a few extra inches.

1227
01:18:18.332 --> 01:18:21.001
But we keep saying,
definitely worth it.

1228
01:18:22.703 --> 01:18:24.271
It changed our lives.

1229
01:18:26.307 --> 01:18:29.877
With women,
completely, of course.

1230
01:18:29.977 --> 01:18:31.745
Women just approach us
and talk to us now,

1231
01:18:31.845 --> 01:18:33.447
which never happened before.

1232
01:18:35.482 --> 01:18:37.985
I haven't struck out since.

1233
01:18:38.085 --> 01:18:40.354
But you can also tell
the difference at work

1234
01:18:40.454 --> 01:18:43.057
and at restaurants
and airports. You're...

1235
01:18:45.459 --> 01:18:47.094
You're just worth more.

1236
01:18:52.032 --> 01:18:53.867
Does this change anything?

1237
01:18:56.003 --> 01:18:57.004
No.

1238
01:18:58.707 --> 01:19:00.007
(SIGHS)

1239
01:19:07.582 --> 01:19:09.783
(SIGHS)

1240
01:19:11.852 --> 01:19:13.354
What are you thinking about?

1241
01:19:15.590 --> 01:19:17.958
I'm thinking that...

1242
01:19:18.058 --> 01:19:21.362
that you should go
to Iceland without me.

1243
01:19:22.731 --> 01:19:24.865
-Why?
-(SIGHS)

1244
01:19:28.102 --> 01:19:30.705
I don't think that you and I
are a good match.

1245
01:19:30.804 --> 01:19:32.039
(SIGHS)

1246
01:19:33.340 --> 01:19:35.376
Is it because
I got the surgery?

1247
01:19:35.476 --> 01:19:38.613
No. Knowing that just makes me
feel like I actually know you.

1248
01:19:38.713 --> 01:19:39.880
Then what?

1249
01:19:42.383 --> 01:19:43.685
It's really hard
for me to feel like

1250
01:19:43.784 --> 01:19:45.620
this is not about the legs.

1251
01:19:45.720 --> 01:19:47.221
It's not.

1252
01:19:47.321 --> 01:19:49.089
When I realized
what you had done,

1253
01:19:49.189 --> 01:19:53.294
it made me feel exactly
how I felt about you before.

1254
01:19:53.394 --> 01:19:54.562
Which is what?

1255
01:19:56.564 --> 01:19:58.299
I'm not in love with you.

1256
01:20:01.068 --> 01:20:03.170
And you're not in love
with me.

1257
01:20:05.005 --> 01:20:08.909
And there's no amount of money
that can fix that.

1258
01:20:10.244 --> 01:20:12.179
But we're such a good match.

1259
01:20:13.847 --> 01:20:15.349
You're exactly
what I'm looking for...

1260
01:20:15.449 --> 01:20:17.217
and I know I can
make your life better.

1261
01:20:17.318 --> 01:20:20.789
Harry, you don't want
to marry me.

1262
01:20:20.888 --> 01:20:22.156
You want to do
business with me,

1263
01:20:22.256 --> 01:20:23.957
just like I want to do
business with you.

1264
01:20:24.058 --> 01:20:25.392
But isn't marriage
a business deal?

1265
01:20:25.492 --> 01:20:26.927
Yes, it is.

1266
01:20:28.395 --> 01:20:30.964
But love has to be
on the table.

1267
01:20:47.314 --> 01:20:49.249
What if I'm not capable of it?

1268
01:20:50.585 --> 01:20:51.919
Of love?

1269
01:20:53.887 --> 01:20:55.956
It makes me feel
like an idiot.

1270
01:20:57.659 --> 01:20:58.859
Like I'm...

1271
01:21:00.160 --> 01:21:02.664
I'm just a clueless... child.

1272
01:21:02.764 --> 01:21:06.534
I feel so... dumb
thinking about it...

1273
01:21:07.935 --> 01:21:09.604
or wanting it.

1274
01:21:09.704 --> 01:21:11.004
I find it...

1275
01:21:12.005 --> 01:21:13.474
so difficult.

1276
01:21:22.851 --> 01:21:25.319
You won't,
when you love someone.

1277
01:21:25.419 --> 01:21:26.487
(SIGHS)

1278
01:21:27.856 --> 01:21:29.423
It'll be easy.

1279
01:21:30.457 --> 01:21:31.458
No math.

1280
01:21:43.237 --> 01:21:45.906
Should I hire you
for your services?

1281
01:21:47.007 --> 01:21:48.175
If you call the office,

1282
01:21:48.275 --> 01:21:50.477
they'll assign
someone great for you.

1283
01:21:54.649 --> 01:21:57.652
