-(DOORBELL RINGING)
-What?

1303
01:23:34.616 --> 01:23:36.350
<i>Hi. It's Lucy.</i>

1304
01:23:38.987 --> 01:23:40.187
<i>I'm sorry.</i>

1305
01:23:40.287 --> 01:23:41.789
No, no, that's okay.
I was just--

1306
01:23:41.890 --> 01:23:42.857
I'll come down there.

1307
01:23:42.957 --> 01:23:45.158
Just give me--
Just don't move.

1308
01:23:45.259 --> 01:23:47.427
(CELL PHONE PLAYING)

1309
01:23:50.063 --> 01:23:52.332
Hey, what the fuck?

1310
01:23:55.904 --> 01:23:57.104
Oh...

1311
01:23:59.072 --> 01:24:00.642
-(OBJECTS CLATTERING)
-Sh...

1312
01:24:00.742 --> 01:24:02.075
Goddamn it.

1313
01:24:02.710 --> 01:24:04.244
(WATER RUNNING)

1314
01:24:09.751 --> 01:24:10.752
Fuck.

1315
01:24:21.996 --> 01:24:23.196
Hi.

1316
01:24:24.398 --> 01:24:25.365
LUCY: Hi.

1317
01:24:25.465 --> 01:24:26.534
(JOHN SIGHS)

1318
01:24:28.335 --> 01:24:30.203
You have a girl up there?

1319
01:24:30.304 --> 01:24:33.340
What? No.
Why would you say that?

1320
01:24:33.440 --> 01:24:35.610
