me to come up. (LAUGHS)

1321
01:24:35.710 --> 01:24:40.213
Oh. Yeah, no,
there's no girl up there.

1322
01:24:42.416 --> 01:24:46.453
Sorry for showing up
without warning.

1323
01:24:46.554 --> 01:24:47.487
I tried calling.

1324
01:24:47.589 --> 01:24:51.258
Sorry. My phone
wasn't charged.

1325
01:24:53.427 --> 01:24:55.830
I'm meant to be
on a plane to Iceland.

1326
01:24:56.965 --> 01:24:58.165
Okay.

1327
01:25:00.500 --> 01:25:02.436
I sublet my apartment
for the week

1328
01:25:02.537 --> 01:25:05.272
that I'm supposed
to be in Iceland...

1329
01:25:05.372 --> 01:25:09.176
so I, uh, don't have
a place to stay.

1330
01:25:12.080 --> 01:25:13.313
Sorry, I don't know
what I'm doing here.

1331
01:25:13.413 --> 01:25:14.849
-It doesn't make any sense.
-No, no.

1332
01:25:14.949 --> 01:25:17.652
-I thought it made sense.
-Wait, wait. Don't go. Stay.

1333
01:25:20.220 --> 01:25:21.756
This was a bad idea.

1334
01:25:21.856 --> 01:25:23.658
No, it's not. It's just...

1335
01:25:24.424 --> 01:25:26.226
My apartment is not...

1336
01:25:28.295 --> 01:25:29.631
