your apartment is like.

1340
01:25:38.773 --> 01:25:41.208
Trust me, it's worse
than you remember.

1341
01:25:48.883 --> 01:25:50.518
Want to drive upstate?

1342
01:25:52.152 --> 01:25:53.420
And go where?

1343
01:25:53.521 --> 01:25:55.255
I don't know.
Just drive around.

1344
01:25:55.355 --> 01:25:56.557
Stay at a hotel.

1345
01:25:58.325 --> 01:26:00.094
I just got the stipend
from my play,

1346
