1360
01:27:36.724 --> 01:27:38.025
(ALL EXCLAIMING)

1361
01:27:38.126 --> 01:27:39.660
(ALL APPLAUDING)

1362
01:27:41.394 --> 01:27:42.563
(ALL CHEERING)

1363
01:27:43.497 --> 01:27:45.700
Oh, he loves her so much.

1364
01:27:47.334 --> 01:27:48.536
Yeah.

1365
01:27:51.005 --> 01:27:54.709
JOHN: And special delivery,
just for you.

1366
01:27:54.809 --> 01:27:55.943
