1367
01:27:56.043 --> 01:27:58.411
LUCY: A white glove service,
handled with care.

1368
01:27:58.513 --> 01:28:00.214
JOHN: If you could
just sign here.

1369
01:28:00.313 --> 01:28:01.616
LUCY: Initial here.

1370
01:28:01.716 --> 01:28:04.652
JOHN: Thank you very much
and have a good day.

1371
01:28:04.752 --> 01:28:06.486
