to make a couple of kids...

1378
01:28:25.940 --> 01:28:28.709
and then you'll get
sick of each other...

1379
01:28:28.810 --> 01:28:30.978
And one of you
will cheat on the other...

1380
01:28:32.412 --> 01:28:33.915
and then you'll fight.

1381
01:28:34.015 --> 01:28:37.350
At first, not in front
of the kids, but then...

1382
01:28:38.085 --> 01:28:39.921
in front of the kids...

1383
01:28:40.021 --> 01:28:43.524
and then you resent the kids
for seeing you fight...

1384
01:28:45.458 --> 01:28:47.028
and then
you file for divorce...

1385
01:28:48.029 --> 01:28:50.363
and you fight about...

1386
01:28:51.299 --> 01:28:53.267
who owns what and...

1387
01:28:53.366 --> 01:28:55.903
who gets the kids
when until it's...

1388
01:28:57.038 --> 01:28:58.105
all over.

1389
01:28:58.206 --> 01:28:59.941
(CROWD CHEERING, APPLAUDING)

1390
01:29:01.909 --> 01:29:04.377
JOHN: Why does anybody
even get married?

1391
01:29:06.814 --> 01:29:08.883
LUCY: Because people tell them
they should.

1392
01:29:10.084 --> 01:29:11.819
And because they're lonely.

1393
01:29:15.590 --> 01:29:17.625
And because they're hopeful.

1394
01:29:19.927 --> 01:29:22.429
<i>They want to do it differently</i>
<i>than their parents.</i>

1395
01:29:22.530 --> 01:29:25.066
(SOFT EMOTIONAL MUSIC
CONTINUING)

1396
