1403
01:31:06.968 --> 01:31:09.036
<i>♪ That's all ♪</i>

1404
01:31:10.338 --> 01:31:12.206
<i>♪ That's all ♪</i>

1405
01:31:13.574 --> 01:31:18.012
<i>♪ I can only give you</i>
<i>Country walks ♪</i>

1406
01:31:18.112 --> 01:31:20.648
