1407
01:31:20.748 --> 01:31:25.953
<i>♪ And a hand to hold</i>
<i>When leaves begin to fall ♪</i>

1408
01:31:27.688 --> 01:31:31.592
<i>♪ And a love</i>
<i>Whose burning light ♪</i>

1409
01:31:31.692 --> 01:31:35.162
<i>♪ Will warm the winter night ♪</i>

1410
01:31:35.262 --> 01:31:37.732
<i>♪ That's all ♪</i>

1411
01:31:38.566 --> 01:31:41.035
<i>♪ That's all ♪</i>

1412
01:31:41.969 --> 01:31:45.573
<i>♪ There are those, I am sure ♪</i>

1413
01:31:45.673 --> 01:31:48.809
<i>♪ That have told you ♪</i>

1414
01:31:48.909 --> 01:31:54.682
<i>♪ They would give you</i>
<i>The world for a toy ♪</i>

1415
01:31:56.017 --> 01:32:02.990
<i>♪ All I have are these arms</i>
