1424
01:32:53.674 --> 01:32:54.909
(SIGHS)

1425
01:33:08.523 --> 01:33:09.957
(INSECTS CHIRPING)

1426
01:33:11.192 --> 01:33:12.226
John.

1427
01:33:13.360 --> 01:33:14.361
John!

1428
01:33:19.133 --> 01:33:20.668
(SIGHS)

1429
01:33:22.069 --> 01:33:24.305
-What is this?
-What is what?

1430
01:33:25.873 --> 01:33:27.608
Are we getting back together?

1431
01:33:31.645 --> 01:33:33.447
Lucy, are we
getting back together?

1432
01:33:33.548 --> 01:33:34.748
I don't know.

1433
01:33:39.286 --> 01:33:40.754
I really don't.

1434
01:33:41.523 --> 01:33:42.923
(SIGHS)

1435
01:33:44.158 --> 01:33:46.660
So you thought you'd just
show up at my door...

1436
01:33:46.760 --> 01:33:48.462
not have a boyfriend,

1437
01:33:48.563 --> 01:33:51.031
agree to get in my car,
kiss me...

1438
01:33:51.132 --> 01:33:53.400
fuck me while you try
to get over someone else...

1439
01:33:53.501 --> 01:33:56.904
and then leave me again?
Is that it?

1440
01:33:57.004 --> 01:33:59.541
-Do you think I'm worthless?
-No, I don't think that.

1441
01:33:59.640 --> 01:34:02.243
-Am I disposable?
-Of course not.

1442
01:34:02.343 --> 01:34:04.245
Do you feel bad for me?

1443
01:34:04.345 --> 01:34:07.114
Poor old John
can't figure his life out?

1444
01:34:08.149 --> 01:34:10.284
-Never.
-Then why are you using me?

1445
01:34:10.384 --> 01:34:11.385
I'm not.

1446
01:34:13.988 --> 01:34:16.223
I'm usually
desperate enough to let you.

1447
01:34:18.792 --> 01:34:20.261
I'm a beggar for you.

1448
01:34:26.934 --> 01:34:28.936
When I see your face...

1449
01:34:30.704 --> 01:34:33.608
I see wrinkles
and grey hair...

1450
01:34:33.707 --> 01:34:35.776
and children
that look like you.

1451
01:34:37.411 --> 01:34:38.679
I can't help it.

1452
01:34:41.448 --> 01:34:42.683
(SIGHS)

1453
01:34:47.688 --> 01:34:49.790
But as your friend...

1454
01:34:49.890 --> 01:34:51.560
I would tell you
it's a bad idea

1455
01:34:51.660 --> 01:34:54.161
to be with a 37-year-old
cater waiter

1456
01:34:54.261 --> 01:34:55.796
who still has roommates.

1457
01:34:57.632 --> 01:34:59.066
I would say...

1458
01:35:00.801 --> 01:35:02.102
