marry a guy

1459
01:35:02.203 --> 01:35:04.905
that has $2,000
in his bank account...

1460
01:35:05.005 --> 01:35:07.642
in a city he can't afford...

1461
01:35:07.741 --> 01:35:09.910
who's only still there...

1462
01:35:10.010 --> 01:35:12.079
to keep trying to be
a theatre actor

1463
01:35:12.179 --> 01:35:15.783
because someone told him
he was good at it once.

1464
01:35:17.718 --> 01:35:19.420
So, where does that leave us?

1465
01:35:21.656 --> 01:35:23.457
Here.

1466
01:35:23.558 --> 01:35:25.359
At someone else's wedding.

1467
01:35:29.463 --> 01:35:30.464
(SCOFFS)

1468
01:35:33.133 --> 01:35:36.904
I can't give you the wedding
or the marriage you want.

1469
01:35:37.004 --> 01:35:39.807
I couldn't even give you
the relationship you wanted.

1470
01:35:42.443 --> 01:35:43.612
It's been years,

1471
01:35:43.712 --> 01:35:45.779
and I still can't afford
to be with you.

1472
01:35:50.384 --> 01:35:51.385
You're right...

1473
01:35:52.186 --> 01:35:53.187
You can't.

1474
01:35:55.789 --> 01:35:56.957
But just because
you can't afford it,

1475
01:35:57.057 --> 01:35:59.460
doesn't mean
it's worth having.

1476
01:36:00.494 --> 01:36:02.263
You don't want me.

1477
01:36:02.363 --> 01:36:04.733
Of course I want you.

1478
01:36:04.832 --> 01:36:06.900
Are you even listening to me?

1479
01:36:07.001 --> 01:36:11.138
John, you and I haven't been
together properly...

1480
01:36:11.238 --> 01:36:15.342
in so long
that you've forgotten.

1481
01:36:15.442 --> 01:36:18.846
You don't want to be with me
because I'm not a good person.

1482
01:36:20.814 --> 01:36:22.550
I'm judgmental...

1483
01:36:23.551 --> 01:36:26.420
and materialistic, and cold.

1484
01:36:28.255 --> 01:36:30.858
I broke up with you
because you're broke.

1485
01:36:31.892 --> 01:36:34.295
I've hurt you over and over.

1486
01:36:36.196 --> 01:36:37.666
You hate me.

1487
01:36:37.766 --> 01:36:39.433
I don't hate you.

1488
01:36:39.534 --> 01:36:40.968
LUCY: You do.

1489
01:36:41.068 --> 01:36:43.937
And you're right to hate me,
because I'm awful.

1490
01:36:45.339 --> 01:36:47.141
Even now...

1491
01:36:47.241 --> 01:36:51.011
I'm thinking:
If I choose to marry you...

1492
01:36:51.111 --> 01:36:52.514
I'm gonna be
sitting across from you

1493
01:36:52.614 --> 01:36:56.050
