for the rest of my life.

1494
01:36:57.184 --> 01:36:59.086
I'll be riding
in your shitty car,

1495
01:36:59.186 --> 01:37:01.255
and living in your
shitty bedroom...

1496
01:37:02.956 --> 01:37:07.729
and fighting with you
about $25.

1497
01:37:07.828 --> 01:37:09.997
I'm weighing being with you...

1498
01:37:10.097 --> 01:37:12.933
against these shit tradeoffs.

1499
01:37:13.901 --> 01:37:15.402
I'm doing math.

1500
01:37:17.104 --> 01:37:18.906
This is what I'm like.

1501
01:37:19.006 --> 01:37:20.307
I know what you're like.

1502
01:37:20.407 --> 01:37:22.610
LUCY: Then how could you
still love me?

1503
01:37:26.581 --> 01:37:27.848
(SIGHS)

1504
01:37:35.055 --> 01:37:37.991
(UPBEAT MUSIC PLAYING
IN DISTANCE)

1505
01:37:38.092 --> 01:37:41.128
(PHONE VIBRATING FAINTLY)

1506
01:37:42.630 --> 01:37:44.865
(PHONE VIBRATING FAINTLY)

1507
01:37:46.433 --> 01:37:47.635
(SIGHS)

1508
01:37:49.970 --> 01:37:52.172
(PHONE VIBRATING)

1509
01:37:53.675 --> 01:37:55.142
-Sophie?
<i>-Lucy.</i>

1510
01:37:55.242 --> 01:37:56.410
<i>I didn't know</i>
<i>who else to call.</i>

1511
01:37:56.511 --> 01:37:57.746
<i>I haven't told anyone.</i>

1512
01:37:57.846 --> 01:37:59.146
<i>I don't have</i>
<i>any friends in the city</i>

1513
01:37:59.246 --> 01:38:00.849
<i>and my lawyers</i>
<i>aren't picking up and...</i>

1514
01:38:00.948 --> 01:38:03.083
-What's going on?
-(DOORBELL BUZZING ON PHONE)

1515
01:38:03.183 --> 01:38:05.953
SOPHIE: <i>Mark is</i>
<i>outside my building.</i>

1516
01:38:06.053 --> 01:38:07.655
(TENSE MUSIC PLAYING)

1517
01:38:07.756 --> 01:38:10.057
<i>I called the cops</i>
<i>but they said they won't come</i>

1518
01:38:10.157 --> 01:38:11.392
<i>unless he's trying</i>
<i>to break in.</i>

1519
01:38:11.492 --> 01:38:13.127
<i>-And...</i>
-(DOORBELL BUZZING ON PHONE)

1520
01:38:13.227 --> 01:38:14.829
<i>he's not trying to break in,</i>

1521
01:38:14.928 --> 01:38:16.430
<i>he's just</i>
<i>buzzing the doorbell.</i>

1522
01:38:16.531 --> 01:38:18.232
That's still harassment,
they should--

1523
01:38:18.332 --> 01:38:21.402
<i>He walked me home</i>
<i>after the date.</i>

1524
01:38:21.502 --> 01:38:24.972
<i>Which I shouldn't have</i>
<i>let him do, but...</i>

1525
01:38:25.072 --> 01:38:27.307
<i>I was scared and...</i>
(EXHALES)

1526
01:38:28.342 --> 01:38:29.943
<i>-It's my fault.</i>
-JOHN: Lucy.

1527
01:38:30.043 --> 01:38:31.245
That's not your fault.

1528
01:38:31.345 --> 01:38:33.013
JOHN: Can we
finish talking, please?

1529
01:38:33.113 --> 01:38:34.214
SOPHIE: <i>He says he just</i>
<i>wants to talk about it,</i>

1530
01:38:34.314 --> 01:38:35.416
<i>but I'm not gonna let him in.</i>

1531
01:38:35.517 --> 01:38:36.751
-No.
-(DOORBELL CONTINUES BUZZING)

1532
01:38:36.851 --> 01:38:38.419
Bolt your door.

1533
01:38:38.520 --> 01:38:40.722
I'm about an hour
outside of Manhattan,

1534
01:38:40.822 --> 01:38:42.322
but I'll try
to get there sooner.

1535
01:38:44.124 --> 01:38:45.092
SOPHIE: <i>I'm worried</i>
<i>someone's going to open</i>

1536
01:38:45.192 --> 01:38:46.561
<i>the building door for him.</i>

1537
01:38:46.661 --> 01:38:48.630
LUCY: I'm almost there.

1538
01:38:48.730 --> 01:38:52.166
<i>He has to leave. He can't stay</i>
<i>outside all night, can he?</i>

1539
01:38:52.266 --> 01:38:55.035
I want you to tell him
someone is on their way.

1540
01:39:01.175 --> 01:39:02.510
(DOORBELL BUZZES)

1541
01:39:03.944 --> 01:39:07.014
(DOOR BUZZES)

1542
01:39:14.054 --> 01:39:15.690
Sophie, it's Lucy.

1543
01:39:17.057 --> 01:39:18.325
SOPHIE: Is he gone?

1544
01:39:18.425 --> 01:39:22.062
Yes. No one was here
when we got here.

1545
01:39:22.162 --> 01:39:23.997
SOPHIE: Oh.
He must've run away

1546
01:39:24.097 --> 01:39:25.499
when I said
that you're coming.

1547
01:39:27.569 --> 01:39:28.969
Can I come in?

1548
01:39:31.438 --> 01:39:34.843
(DOOR LATCH CLICKS,
CREAKS OPEN)

1549
01:39:34.943 --> 01:39:37.010
-Hi.
-Hi.

1550
01:39:47.020 --> 01:39:49.022
How are you holding up?

1551
01:39:49.122 --> 01:39:52.861
Uh, not good.
(CHUCKLES NERVOUSLY, SIGHS)

1552
01:39:52.961 --> 01:39:55.429
(EXHALES)
Mark sounded really angry.

1553
01:39:55.530 --> 01:39:56.997
(SHUDDERING)

1554
01:39:58.766 --> 01:40:01.168
Well, he's angry because...

1555
01:40:01.268 --> 01:40:04.505
he thought he was going
to get away with something...

1556
01:40:05.540 --> 01:40:06.541
but he won't...

1557
01:40:08.008 --> 01:40:10.177
because you're not
going to let him.

1558
01:40:11.144 --> 01:40:13.113
You are brave.

1559
01:40:17.451 --> 01:40:18.620
Can I hug you?

1560
01:40:18.720 --> 01:40:20.254
(SOBS)

1561
01:40:24.324 --> 01:40:25.593
(CRYING)

1562
01:40:29.998 --> 01:40:33.500
(CRYING)

1563
01:40:46.280 --> 01:40:48.750
You know what I've been
thinking about? (SNIFFLES)

1564
01:40:48.850 --> 01:40:50.050
(WHISPERING) What?

1565
01:40:51.118 --> 01:40:53.153
I really need
to get a boyfriend

1566
01:40:53.253 --> 01:40:54.488
so that I have someone to call

1567
01:40:54.589 --> 01:40:56.791
that's not
my fucking matchmaker.

1568
01:40:56.891 --> 01:40:59.393
(BOTH LAUGH)

1569
01:41:01.896 --> 01:41:03.531
I'm going to die alone.

1570
01:41:03.631 --> 01:41:05.299
(LAUGHS)

1571
01:41:05.399 --> 01:41:06.400
Sophie.

1572
01:41:09.003 --> 01:41:10.538
(SIGHS WEARILY)

1573
01:41:10.638 --> 01:41:14.341
I promise you, you're going to
marry the love of your life.

1574
01:41:16.310 --> 01:41:18.513
You don't expect me
to believe that.

1575
01:41:19.479 --> 01:41:21.348
You don't have to believe it.

1576
01:41:22.684 --> 01:41:24.151
I believe it.

1577
01:41:25.185 --> 01:41:26.654
SOPHIE: Let me guess.

1578
01:41:26.754 --> 01:41:29.423
Someone who checks a lot of
my boxes? (CHUCKLES DRYLY)

1579
01:41:30.290 --> 01:41:32.927
I'm not asking for a miracle.

1580
01:41:33.027 --> 01:41:35.162
I just want to love someone.

1581
01:41:36.564 --> 01:41:39.701
<i>Someone who can't help</i>
<i>but love me back.</i>

1582
01:41:50.979 --> 01:41:51.946
She's asleep.

1583
01:41:52.046 --> 01:41:53.848
Good.

1584
01:41:55.115 --> 01:41:56.316
You okay?

1585
01:41:56.718 --> 01:41:57.752
Yeah.

1586
01:42:00.220 --> 01:42:02.155
You should go home.

1587
01:42:02.255 --> 01:42:03.390
I'll take you home first.

1588
01:42:03.490 --> 01:42:05.258
I'm gonna sleep
on her couch...

1589
01:42:05.359 --> 01:42:08.228
and help her get
a restraining order
when she wakes up.

1590
01:42:08.630 --> 01:42:09.864
Okay.

1591
01:42:12.834 --> 01:42:14.167
Thanks for the ride.

1592
01:42:15.103 --> 01:42:16.638
Yeah, of course.

1593
01:42:26.446 --> 01:42:28.448
You asked
how I could love you.

1594
01:42:33.220 --> 01:42:34.622
I just do.

1595
01:42:36.390 --> 01:42:37.892
It's the easiest thing.

1596
01:42:42.697 --> 01:42:44.297
I love you too.

1597
01:42:47.434 --> 01:42:49.169
(CHUCKLES) More than you know.

1598
01:42:52.807 --> 01:42:56.309
You're the only reason I know
I'm capable of love.

1599
01:43:01.415 --> 01:43:03.450
I've been doing some math.

1600
01:43:04.952 --> 01:43:06.621
-Yeah?
-Yeah.

1601
01:43:08.089 --> 01:43:10.457
And I'm ready
to make you an offer.

1602
01:43:11.559 --> 01:43:12.560
Okay.

1603
01:43:13.928 --> 01:43:15.429
Here's the offer.

1604
01:43:19.266 --> 01:43:22.603
I love you now,
like I loved you before...

1605
01:43:24.438 --> 01:43:26.507
I'll love you
'til the day I die.

1606
01:43:28.943 --> 01:43:30.745
It's a lifetime guarantee.

1607
01:43:32.714 --> 01:43:35.116
And I won't forget it
the way I used to...

1608
01:43:35.215 --> 01:43:36.884
even when things are shit.

1609
01:43:39.187 --> 01:43:41.488
I'll make a calendar item

1610
01:43:41.589 --> 01:43:44.692
every day reminding myself
that I love you.

1611
01:43:45.960 --> 01:43:47.528
I'll be your certainty.

1612
01:43:52.466 --> 01:43:54.267
It's my final offer.

1613
01:43:55.636 --> 01:43:58.206
You can't negotiate because

1614
01:43:58.305 --> 01:44:00.373
I don't have anything else
to offer you.

1615
01:44:09.617 --> 01:44:10.618
Deal.

1616
01:44:12.053 --> 01:44:14.287
(SOFT ROMANTIC MUSIC PLAYING)

1617
01:44:20.595 --> 01:44:22.130
Now I admit, I'm not confident

1618
01:44:22.230 --> 01:44:25.298
that I can make myself
less broke.

1619
01:44:25.398 --> 01:44:27.300
You don't need
to worry about that.

1620
01:44:27.400 --> 01:44:29.737
You know
I can take care of myself.

1621
01:44:31.005 --> 01:44:32.206
Yeah, I know.

1622
01:44:32.305 --> 01:44:33.508
It's not for you.

1623
01:44:34.242 --> 01:44:35.442
It's for me.

1624
01:44:36.144 --> 01:44:37.344
For us.

1625
01:44:38.579 --> 01:44:39.714
You make me brave enough

1626
01:44:39.814 --> 01:44:42.016
to admit that
I want to be happy.

1627
01:44:43.350 --> 01:44:45.385
And I want to be happy
with you.

1628
01:44:50.625 --> 01:44:53.961
And I'm gonna pick up
more catering shifts...

1629
01:44:54.061 --> 01:44:55.997
And ask for a raise...

1630
01:44:56.097 --> 01:45:00.300
I'll find a serving job
at an actual restaurant...

1631
01:45:00.400 --> 01:45:02.136
And I won't say no
to commercial auditions,

1632
01:45:02.236 --> 01:45:03.771
even though
they're annoying...

1633
01:45:03.871 --> 01:45:06.406
I'll make an actual effort
to find a manager.

1634
01:45:06.507 --> 01:45:08.609
(MUSIC SWELLS)

1635
01:45:24.559 --> 01:45:26.994
And I'm going to move out
of my apartment.

1636
01:45:27.795 --> 01:45:29.197
And sell my car.

1637
01:45:29.297 --> 01:45:30.698
Don't sell your car.

1638
01:45:31.599 --> 01:45:32.399
No?

1639
01:45:32.499 --> 01:45:34.334
No, let's just...

1640
01:45:35.502 --> 01:45:37.872
Let's just
drive around in it...

1641
01:45:37.972 --> 01:45:41.642
until it breaks down
and it won't move anymore.

1642
01:45:43.277 --> 01:45:44.846
(MUSIC SWELLS)

1643
01:46:00.962 --> 01:46:02.997
(BIRDS CHIRPING)

1644
01:46:15.643 --> 01:46:16.844
LUCY: <i>I've been dreaming about</i>

1645
01:46:16.944 --> 01:46:19.479
<i>the first people</i>
<i>who got married.</i>

1646
01:46:21.582 --> 01:46:25.319
<i>Two cavepeople...</i>
<i>fell in love...</i>

1647
01:46:25.418 --> 01:46:27.955
<i>in between the hunting</i>
<i>and the gathering.</i>

1648
01:46:30.157 --> 01:46:31.659
<i>And in my dream...</i>

1649
01:46:33.127 --> 01:46:34.996
<i>I keep asking myself...</i>

1650
01:46:36.931 --> 01:46:39.634
<i>what made them perfect</i>
<i>for each other?</i>

1651
01:46:42.670 --> 01:46:45.106
<i>Similar economic background?</i>

1652
01:46:46.641 --> 01:46:48.475
<i>Politically aligned?</i>

1653
01:46:49.744 --> 01:46:52.713
<i>Well-matched</i>
<i>in their attractiveness?</i>

1654
01:46:54.649 --> 01:46:56.550
<i>Similar upbringing?</i>

1655
01:47:00.955 --> 01:47:01.956
<i>Or...</i>

1656
01:47:03.057 --> 01:47:04.725
<i>was it something else?</i>

1657
01:47:08.729 --> 01:47:10.398
<i>Something like you and me?</i>

1658
01:47:10.531 --> 01:47:12.033
(ROMANTIC MUSIC CONTINUING)

1659
01:47:21.876 --> 01:47:22.743
Hey, man.

1660
01:47:22.843 --> 01:47:24.745
Can I get
two chicken over rice?

1661
01:47:24.845 --> 01:47:25.980
MAN: Yeah.

1662
01:47:37.224 --> 01:47:39.226
Thanks a lot. Keep that.

1663
01:47:53.574 --> 01:47:55.242
I'm sad you're leaving, Vi.

1664
01:47:55.343 --> 01:47:58.145
VIOLET: <i>Me too. They really</i>
<i>need me at the London office.</i>

1665
01:47:58.245 --> 01:48:01.816
<i>And I'm calling you first</i>
<i>of all the Adore girls...</i>

1666
01:48:01.916 --> 01:48:05.419
<i>because the CEOs asked me</i>
<i>who should be asked to step up</i>

1667
01:48:05.519 --> 01:48:07.888
<i>and be promoted...</i>
<i>to New York head</i>

1668
01:48:07.989 --> 01:48:10.992
<i>and I said it absolutely</i>
<i>has to be you.</i>

1669
01:48:11.092 --> 01:48:12.593
-Me?
<i>-Yes.</i>

1670
01:48:12.693 --> 01:48:14.929
<i>-You're getting a promotion.</i>
-(LUCY CHUCKLES SOFTLY)

1671
01:48:15.396 --> 01:48:16.364
(LAUGHS)

1672
01:48:16.464 --> 01:48:18.399
VIOLET: <i>What's so funny?</i>

1673
01:48:18.498 --> 01:48:20.868
Well, I was going to hand in

1674
01:48:20.968 --> 01:48:23.437
my resignation letter
tomorrow.

1675
01:48:23.537 --> 01:48:24.905
VIOLET: <i>No, you weren't.</i>

1676
01:48:25.006 --> 01:48:27.808
Yep. I have it printed out
and everything.

1677
01:48:27.908 --> 01:48:29.744
VIOLET: <i>You can't quit.</i>

1678
01:48:29.844 --> 01:48:31.712
<i>What would you do instead?</i>

1679
01:48:32.380 --> 01:48:34.448
I honestly don't know.

1680
01:48:34.548 --> 01:48:36.550
Maybe marry someone poor.

1681
01:48:36.650 --> 01:48:38.319
(CHUCKLES SOFTLY)

1682
01:48:38.419 --> 01:48:39.420
VIOLET: <i>I don't know</i>

1683
01:48:39.520 --> 01:48:41.555
<i>what you're talking about.</i>

1684
01:48:41.655 --> 01:48:43.257
<i>Just think about it.</i>

1685
01:48:43.357 --> 01:48:44.291
<i>You can negotiate</i>

1686
01:48:44.392 --> 01:48:45.459
<i>a crazy salary, too.</i>

1687
01:48:45.559 --> 01:48:47.428
<i>Ask for any amount you want,</i>

1688
01:48:47.528 --> 01:48:49.363
<i>and I'll support you. Okay?</i>

1689
01:48:49.463 --> 01:48:51.365
Okay, I'll think about it.

1690
01:48:51.465 --> 01:48:53.601
Vi, I have to go.
My boyfriend's here.

1691
01:48:53.701 --> 01:48:54.935
VIOLET: <i>Yeah,</i>
<i>before you go, tell me:</i>

1692
01:48:55.036 --> 01:48:57.671
<i>How did Sophie L.'s date</i>
<i>go last night?</i>

1693
01:48:58.239 --> 01:48:59.573
She liked him.

1694
01:49:00.574 --> 01:49:01.976
VIOLET: <i>Brian A., right?</i>

1695
01:49:02.443 --> 01:49:03.644
Yeah.

1696
01:49:04.578 --> 01:49:08.082
5'8". 36. Dentist.

1697
01:49:08.182 --> 01:49:09.650
200 grand before taxes.

1698
01:49:09.750 --> 01:49:12.920
Just...
looking for a nice girl.

1699
01:49:13.020 --> 01:49:15.189
VIOLET: <i>Sounds like</i>
<i>a strong match.</i>

1700
01:49:15.289 --> 01:49:16.457
(CHUCKLES)

1701
01:49:16.557 --> 01:49:18.259
He liked her too.

1702
01:49:18.359 --> 01:49:21.062
We are cautiously optimistic.

1703
01:49:21.162 --> 01:49:22.730
VIOLET: <i>Good.</i>

1704
01:49:22.830 --> 01:49:25.766
<i>You should know Harry C.</i>
<i>is going on his first date.</i>

1705
01:49:25.866 --> 01:49:27.668
<i>Rose made a very strong match.</i>

1706
01:49:27.768 --> 01:49:31.439
<i>Gemma N., 30, an art dealer.</i>

1707
01:49:31.540 --> 01:49:32.873
Vi, I have to go.

1708
01:49:32.973 --> 01:49:35.876
VIOLET: <i>Fine,</i>
<i>but hear the offer first.</i>

1709
01:49:35.976 --> 01:49:36.944
I will.

1710
01:49:37.044 --> 01:49:38.045
VIOLET: <i>Call me.</i>

1711
01:49:42.016 --> 01:49:43.284
Hi.

1712
01:49:43.384 --> 01:49:44.585
Hi.

1713
01:49:53.294 --> 01:49:56.363
How would you like to make
a very bad financial decision?

1714
01:50:00.334 --> 01:50:02.369
(ROMANTIC INDIE MUSIC PLAYING)

1715
01:50:22.756 --> 01:50:24.992
(LIVELY CHATTER)

1716
01:53:56.705 --> 01:53:57.739
(MUSIC FADES)

1717
01:53:57.838 --> 01:54:00.007
(INDISTINCT ANNOUNCEMENT
ON PA)

1718
01:54:01.743 --> 01:54:03.944
(ROMANTIC FOLK MUSIC PLAYING)

1719
01:56:07.936 --> 01:56:09.136
(MUSIC FADES)
